{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36665","headline":"寄渭北徐从事 · 罗隐","name":"寄渭北徐从事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暖云慵堕柳垂条，骢马徐郎过渭桥。\n官秩旧参荀秘监，罇罍今伴霍嫖姚。\n科随鹄箭频曾中，礼向侯弓以重招。\n莫恨东风促行李，不多时节却归朝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36665.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36665","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}